<%# The way back to an unnarrowed list (S7, decision E5).

    Shown only while something actually narrows the list, and "something" counts
    the SEARCH and "Nur meine Zeiten" as well: otherwise a filter narrows the
    list while the way out of it is invisible. The rule has one owner,
    TimeSessionsHelper#time_filter_active_count, which the mobile badge counts
    with too.

    ⚠️ Its own partial with an id, because it must be able to ARRIVE ON ITS OWN.
    It sits outside time_sessions_list_frame while the search box targets that
    frame, and its very existence depends on the search -- so without travelling
    with the frame answer, typing a search would empty the list and leave no way
    back. _index_table sends it along; the same trick and the same reason as the
    status pills since S2.

    ⚠️ Green, and the plan's F7 note says the reset must NOT be green because
    green is the action colour. The user's own layout (02.09.2026) puts it in
    green at the end of the switch row, and a later drawing beats an earlier
    note. It is the one thing in the line that UNDOES rather than narrows, so it
    is the one thing that reads as an action.

    ⚠️ It leads to the NEUTRAL list, not to the bare address. The bare address
    re-applies the two defaults (this month, billed hidden), and in the very case
    a reader needs this link for -- the only booking is old AND billed -- that is
    the same empty page again. %>
<%# ⚠️ @filter_state is nil on one path: create.turbo_stream renders this table
    too, and its list is unfiltered, so no diagnosis and no state are built for
    it. The span still has to exist there -- it is a stream target -- but there
    is no question to answer, and asking anyway crashed the whole create with
    "undefined method [] for nil". %>
<span id="time_filter_reset" class="ml-auto">
  <% if @filter_state.present? && time_filter_reset_offered?(@filter_state) %>
    <%= link_to t('views.organisations.time_sessions.index.filter_reset'),
                time_list_path(current_organisation, **TimeSession::LIST_NEUTRAL_DRILLDOWN_PARAMS),
                data: { turbo_frame: '_top', filter_reset: true },
                class: 'text-sm text-lime-700 hover:text-lime-800 hover:underline underline-offset-2' %>
  <% end %>
</span>
